export function templateFonts(tp){const th=TH[tp.theme];return [th.head,th.body,th.script].filter(Boolean).concat(tp.fam==='apparel'||tp.fam==='hat'?['Alfa Slab One','Anton','Kaushan Script','Manrope','Great Vibes']:[]);}

// ctx: {W,H (inches), bleed, fold, sideKey, garmentDark}
export function buildTemplate(tp,ctx){const th=TH[tp.theme];const c={...ctx,r:ctx.W/ctx.H,mn:Math.min(ctx.W,ctx.H)};c.dark=!!ctx.garmentDark;c.ink=c.dark?'#ffffff':'#151515';
 let out;if(tp.fam==='brochure')out=brochure(c,th,Number(tp.lay.slice(1)));else{const fn=FAMILY_LAYOUTS[tp.fam][tp.lay];out=fn(c,th);}
 if(th.rtl&&!out.noMirror){out.layers=mirror(out.layers);if(out.back)out.back.layers=mirror(out.back.layers);}
 if(tp.fam==='vehicle'&&/passenger/.test(ctx.sideKey||''))out.layers=mirror(out.layers,true);
 return out;}
function mirror(layers,flipOnly=false){return layers.map(l=>{const m={...l};if(l.type==='text'){m.x=1-l.x;if(!flipOnly||l.align!=='center')m.align=l.align==='left'?'right':l.align==='right'?'left':'center';}else m.x=1-l.x-l.w;return m;});}

/* ---------------- spec → studio layers ---------------- */
// measure(text,font,bold,italic,px) → width in px. dims: {width,height,bleed}. Returns layers in the studio format.
export function realizeLayers(specs,dims,measure,newId){const W=dims.width,H=dims.height,mn=Math.min(W,H),ex=((dims.bleed||0)+.06)/W,ey=((dims.bleed||0)+.06)/H,out=[];
 for(const s of specs){const l={id:newId(),type:s.type,rotation:0,opacity:s.opacity??1,color:s.color};
  if(s.gradient)l.gradient={to:s.gradient.to,angle:s.gradient.angle||0};if(s.radius)l.radius=s.radius;if(s.outline)l.outline=Math.max(.5,Math.min(200,s.outline));
  if(s.type==='text'){Object.assign(l,{text:s.text,font:s.font,align:s.align||'center',bold:!!s.bold,italic:!!s.italic});if(s.spacing)l.spacing=s.spacing;placeText(l,s,dims,measure);}
  else if(s.type==='line'){Object.assign(l,{x:s.x,y:s.y,w:s.w,h:.001,stroke:Math.max(.5,Math.min(100,s.st*mn*100))});}
  else{let {x,y,w,h}=s;if(s.type==='shape')l.shape=s.shape;
   if(s.bleed!==false&&!s.outline){if(x<=.001){w+=x+ex;x=-ex;}if(x+w>=.999)w=1+ex-x;if(y<=.001){h+=y+ey;y=-ey;}if(y+h>=.999)h=1+ey-y;}
   Object.assign(l,{x,y,w:Math.max(.001,w),h:Math.max(.001,h)});}
  out.push(l);}
 return out;}
// font size from the spec, shrunk until the text fits its max width (and max height for rotated text)
export function placeText(l,s,dims,measure){s={x:.5,...s};const W=dims.width*100,H=dims.height*100,mn=Math.min(W,H),rot=Math.abs(s.rot||0)===90;let f=Math.max(4*100/72,Math.min(2000*100/72,s.size*mn));const lines=l.text.split('\n');
 const widthAt=f=>{let w=Math.max(f*.3,...lines.map(t=>measure(t,l.font,l.bold,l.italic,f)));if(l.spacing)w+=Math.max(0,Math.max(...lines.map(t=>[...t].length))-1)*l.spacing*f;return w*1.03;};
 const axis=(s.rot&&rot?H:W)*(s.maxW??.9);let w=widthAt(f);if(w>axis){f*=axis/w;w=widthAt(f);}
 if(rot){const hh=(f*1.2*(lines.length-1)+f*1.25);const lim=W*(s.maxH??.8);if(hh>lim){f*=lim/hh;w=widthAt(f);}}
 f=Math.max(4*100/72,f);l.fontSize=Math.round(f*72/100*10)/10;w=widthAt(f);const h=f*1.2*(lines.length-1)+f*1.25;
 l.w=Math.min(4,w/W);l.h=Math.min(4,h/H);
 if(s.rot){l.rotation=s.rot;l.x=s.x-l.w/2;l.y=s.y-l.h/2;}
 else{l.x=l.align==='left'?s.x:l.align==='right'?s.x-l.w:s.x-l.w/2;l.y=s.y;}
 return l;}
